  "description": "Cross-platform, software-rendered acrylic / frosted-glass backdrop for AvaloniaUI — a SkiaSharp SKRuntimeEffect shader pipeline (vibrancy, blur, rounded-rect lens, tint, highlight). Renders entirely via Avalonia's Skia backend, so it works on Windows, macOS, Linux and the browser with no OS backdrop support required. Companion to Fluid.Avalonia; a renamed fork of the MIT-licensed LiquidGlassAvaloniaUI by KaranocaVe.",
